"conroling"
"          Controling Outputs           º                                      "
"                                       º                                      "
"To manuly turn the parallel port's     º                                       "
"BITs on or off press a key below the   º                                       "
"on-srceen BIT box once, this will      º                                       "
"latch that bit on. Unlatching is done  º                                       "
"by pressing the same key. You can      º                                       "
"latch or unlatch any other BITs while  º                                       "
"not afecting other BIts.               º                                       "
"                                       º      x     = Exit this A/Q box        "
"usgro"
"         Using Groups                  º       Saving a set of groups          "
"                                       º                                       "
"Groups enable you to turn multiple     ºThis feature will save a whole         "
"BITs on with one keystroke.            ºset of banks into a new file that      "
"To Configure groups, go in to groups   ºcan be reopened on new sessions.       "
"to save the current set of lached BITs º  To save, go into groups then         "
"into number keys 0-9. To do this press ºsave. The file name must be in DOS     "
"the number key(s), then exit with 'x'. º                             PTO       "
"Then refigure the BITs and repeat,     º      n     = Next page                "
"saving into different keys (banks).    º      x     = Exit this A/Q box        "
